	<Placemark>
		<name>索菲亚教堂</name>
		<description>http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hagia_Sophia

The Church of the Holy Wisdom, variously known as Hagia Sophia (Άγια Σοφία) in Greek, Sancta Sophia in Latin or Ayasofya in Turkish, is a former Greek Orthodox church and mosque now a museum, in Istanbul, formerly Constantinople. It is universally acknowledged as one of the great buildings of the world.</description>
